#: ../../api-reference.md:3
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Ireferensi ye-API"

#: ../../api-reference.md:5
msgid ""
"This page is generated from the OpenAPI file, which is exported from the "
"service code. When the API changes, this page changes with it."
msgstr ""
"Leli khasi likhiqizwa efayeleni le-OpenAPI, elikhishwa kukhodi yesevisi. "
"Uma i-API ishintsha, leli khasi nalo liyashintsha."

#: ../../api-reference.md:7
msgid ""
"All endpoints except `/health` need an API key. See "
"[Authentication](authentication.md)."
msgstr ""
"Wonke ama-endpoint ngaphandle kwe-`/health` adinga i-API key. Bheka "
"[Ukuqinisekisa](authentication.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:9
msgid "POST /v1/generate"
msgstr "POST /v1/generate"

#: ../../api-reference.md:11
msgid "**Generate text**"
msgstr "**Khiqiza umbhalo**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:13
msgid ""
"Sends a prompt to a model and returns the response. The response includes"
" an X-Data-Region header that echoes the region that processed the "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Ithumela i-prompt kumodeli bese ibuyisa impendulo. Impendulo iqukethe "
"i-header ye-X-Data-Region ekhombisa isifunda esicutshungule isicelo."

#: ../../api-reference.md:15 ../../api-reference.md:74
#: ../../api-reference.md:104
msgid "Requires an API key."
msgstr "Idinga i-API key."

#: ../../api-reference.md:17 ../../api-reference.md:106
msgid "Request body"
msgstr "Umzimba wesicelo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Inkambu"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Kuyadingeka"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Incazelo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Yebo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "ID of the model to use. List them with GET /v1/models."
msgstr "I-ID yemodeli ezosetshenziswa. Wabale nge-GET /v1/models."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt`"
msgstr "`prompt`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The text you want the model to respond to. Length 1 to 4000 characters."
msgstr ""
"Umbhalo ofuna imodeli iwuphendule. Ubude busuka kuzinhlamvu ezingu-1 kuye "
"kwezi-4000."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Cha"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Language code of the prompt. Each model supports a different set. "
"Default: `\"en\"`."
msgstr ""
"Ikhodi yolimi ye-prompt. Imodeli ngayinye isekela iqoqo elihlukile. "
"Okuzenzakalelayo: `\"en\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "integer"
msgstr "integer"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Upper limit on tokens in the response. Cannot exceed the model's "
"max_output_tokens. Default: `64`. Minimum 1."
msgstr ""
"Umkhawulo ophezulu wama-token empendulweni. Awukwazi ukudlula "
"`max_output_tokens` yemodeli. Okuzenzakalelayo: `64`. Ubuncane: 1."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`region`"
msgstr "`region`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Where the request is processed: ke, ug, ma or mu. Default: `\"ke\"`."
msgstr ""
"Lapho isicelo sicutshungulwa khona: ke, ug, ma noma mu. "
"Okuzenzakalelayo: `\"ke\"`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:27 ../../api-reference.md:112
msgid "Example request body:"
msgstr "Isibonelo somzimba wesicelo:"

#: ../../api-reference.md:39 ../../api-reference.md:76
#: ../../api-reference.md:120 ../../api-reference.md:145
msgid "Responses"
msgstr "Izimpendulo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Isimo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Incazelo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "200"
msgstr "200"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text and token usage."
msgstr "Umbhalo okhiqiziwe nokusetshenziswa kwama-token."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The request was invalid. Check the message field."
msgstr "Isicelo besingavumelekile. Hlola inkambu ye-message."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The API key is missing or not valid."
msgstr "I-API key ayikho noma ayivumelekile."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model or endpoint does not exist."
msgstr "Imodeli noma i-endpoint ayikho."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"Rate limit exceeded. Wait for the number of seconds in the Retry-After "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Umkhawulo wezicelo weqiwe. Linda inani lamasekhondi eliboniswe ku-header "
"ye-Retry-After."

#: ../../api-reference.md:49 ../../api-reference.md:84
#: ../../api-reference.md:129 ../../api-reference.md:151
msgid "A `200` response has these fields."
msgstr "Impendulo engu-`200` inalezi zinkambu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Unique ID for this generation."
msgstr "I-ID eyingqayizivele yalokhu kukhiqiza."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "Imodeli ephathe isicelo."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The language code you sent."
msgstr "Ikhodi yolimi oyithumele."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Umbhalo okhiqiziwe."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "string, one of `stop`, `length`"
msgstr "string, eyodwa kwezi `stop`, `length`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid ""
"stop means the response ended naturally. length means it was cut off at "
"max_tokens."
msgstr ""
"`stop` kusho ukuthi impendulo iphele ngokwemvelo. `length` kusho ukuthi "
"impendulo inqanyulwe ku-`max_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Usage object"
msgstr "Into yokusetshenziswa"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Token counts for this request."
msgstr "Inani lama-token alesi sicelo."

#: ../../api-reference.md:60
msgid "The `usage` object has these fields."
msgstr "Into ye-`usage` inalezi zinkambu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`prompt_tokens`"
msgstr "`prompt_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the prompt."
msgstr "Ama-token akwi-prompt."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`completion_tokens`"
msgstr "`completion_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Tokens in the response."
msgstr "Ama-token empendulweni."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`total_tokens`"
msgstr "`total_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "prompt_tokens plus completion_tokens."
msgstr "`prompt_tokens` kanye ne-`completion_tokens`."

#: ../../api-reference.md:68 ../../api-reference.md:98
#: ../../api-reference.md:137
msgid "Failures use the standard error body described in [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ukwehluleka kusebenzisa umzimba wephutha ojwayelekile ochazwe ku-"
"[Amaphutha](errors.md)."

#: ../../api-reference.md:70
msgid "GET /v1/models"
msgstr "GET /v1/models"

#: ../../api-reference.md:72
msgid "**List models**"
msgstr "**Bhala amamodeli**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The models you can use."
msgstr "Amamodeli ongawasebenzisa."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`data`"
msgstr "`data`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of ModelInfo object"
msgstr "uhlu lwezinto ze-ModelInfo"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The available models."
msgstr "Amamodeli atholakalayo."

#: ../../api-reference.md:90
msgid "Each item in `data` has these fields."
msgstr "Into ngayinye ku-`data` inalezi zinkambu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Model ID. Pass this as model when you generate text."
msgstr "I-ID yemodeli. Yidlulise njenge-`model` lapho ukhiqiza umbhalo."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`max_output_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_output_tokens`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Largest max_tokens value this model accepts."
msgstr "Inani elikhulu le-`max_tokens` elamukelwa yile modeli."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`languages`"
msgstr "`languages`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "array of string"
msgstr "uhlu lwama-string"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Language codes this model accepts."
msgstr "Amakhodi ezilimi amukelwa yile modeli."

#: ../../api-reference.md:100
msgid "POST /v1/tokens/count"
msgstr "POST /v1/tokens/count"

#: ../../api-reference.md:102
msgid "**Count tokens**"
msgstr "**Bala ama-token**"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`text`"
msgstr "`text`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Text to count tokens for. Length 1 to 20000 characters."
msgstr "Umbhalo okuzobalwa kuwo ama-token. Ubude busuka ku-1 kuye ku-20000 izinhlamvu."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The token count for the text."
msgstr "Inani lama-token embhalweni."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Inani lama-token embhalweni."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Number of words in the text, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Inani lamagama embhalweni, ahlukaniswe ngezikhala."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "number"
msgstr "number"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "token_count divided by word_count, rounded to two decimals."
msgstr "`token_count` ihlukaniswe nge-`word_count`, isongwe ibe ngamadesimali amabili."

#: ../../api-reference.md:139
msgid "GET /health"
msgstr "GET /health"

#: ../../api-reference.md:141
msgid "**Check service health**"
msgstr "**Hlola isimo sesevisi**"

#: ../../api-reference.md:143
msgid "No API key needed."
msgstr "Ayikho i-API key edingekayo."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "The service is running."
msgstr "Isevisi iyasebenza."

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "`status`"
msgstr "`status`"

#: ../../api-reference.md
msgid "Always ok when the service is running."
msgstr "Ihlala ithi `ok` uma isevisi isebenza."